  <section><para>The graph below shows the number of customers, \(C\), in a restaurant \(x\) hours after 8 a.m.</para>
<para>What does \(C(14)\) equal, and what does it mean?</para>
<para><figure><media alt="A GRAPHED FUNCTION, WHERE NUMBER OF CUSTOMERS IS A FUNCTION OF THE NUMBER OF HOURS AFTER 8 AM. THE GRAPH INCREASES, DECREASES, INCREASES, AND THEN DECREASES AGAIN."><image mime-type="image/png" src="https://k12.openstax.org/contents/raise/resources/129d13b346d30517bb902d70d66e3365d1a59e4f"/></media></figure></para></section>
